REST API
**OpenHands Cloud** (`/openhands/usage/run-openhands/cloud`): Hosted solution 
with integrations
**OpenHands Enterprise**: Self-hosted deployment with extended support

Always provide links to the relevant documentation pages for users who want to 
learn more.
